<title>USA: Dell Computer to open second U.S. plant.</title>
<headline>Dell Computer to open second U.S. plant.</headline>
<dateline>AUSTIN, Texas 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dell Computer Corp said on Tuesday it plans to open a second U.S. manufacturing facility.</p>
<p>Dell said it plans to lease a 256,000-square-foot manufacturing facility under construction in North Austin and add more than 1,000 manufacturing jobs when it is fully staffed.</p>
<p>Dell did not say when it expected the plant would be ready and when it would be fully staffed.</p>
</text>
